    <key>it</key>
    <value>Install 1C:Enterprise Extension</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Install 1C:Enterprise Extension</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationNote</name>
    <id>6</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>For better application experience, it is recommended that you install 1C:Enterprise Extension.
Do you want to install it?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>برای تجربه بهتر برنامه، توصیه می‌شود افزونه 1C:Enterprise را نصب کنید.
آیا می‌خواهید آن را نصب کنید؟</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Для удобной работы с приложением предлагается установить расширение для работы с 1С:Предприятием. 
Установить?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Uygulamayla rahat çalışma için 1C:Enterprise ile çalışmaya yönelik uzantının kurulması önerilmektedir. 
Kurulsun mu?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Để làm việc thuận tiện với ứng dụng, nên cài đặt tiện ích mở rộng cho 1C:Enterprise. 
Cài đặt?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>For better application experience, it is recommended that you install 1C:Enterprise Extension.
Do you want to install it?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>For better application experience, it is recommended that you install 1C:Enterprise Extension.
Do you want to install it?</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationNoteExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>14</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>DecorationNoteContextMenu</name>
